{{head|ang|suffix|head=-en|g=n}}

# {{lb|ang|causes i-mutation}} {{non-gloss|used to create diminutive neuter nouns}}
#: {{suffixusex|ang|mæġeþ|t1=girl|mæġden}} (“girl,” originally “little girl”)
#: {{suffixusex|ang|cocc|t1=rooster|[[ċycen]], [[ċicen]]|t2=chick}}
