====Suffix====
{{head|ang|suffix|head=-en|g=f}}

# {{senseid|ang|female}} {{lb|ang|often causes i-mutation}} {{non-gloss|used to create feminine nouns from other nouns}}
#: {{suffixusex|ang|god|t1=(male) god|gyden|t2=goddess}} {{qualifier|with i-mutation}}
