{{ety|ang|:inh|gmw-pro:*-īn<id:adjective>|id=adjectival}}
{{inh+|ang|gmw-pro|*-īn}}, from {{inh|ang|gem-pro|*-īnaz}}.

====Suffix====
{{h|ang|suf}}

# {{lb|ang|causes i-mutation}} {{non-gloss|adjectival suffix meaning "material made of, consisting of”, also sometimes “characteristic of”.}}
#: {{suffixusex|ang|gold|t1=gold|gylden|t2=golden}}
#: {{suffixusex|ang|ātor|t1=poison|ǣtren|t2=venomous, poisonous}}
#: {{suffixusex|ang|stān|t1=stone|stǣnen|t2=stonen}}
#: {{suffixusex|ang|āc|t1=oak|ǣcen|t2=oaken}}
#: {{suffixusex|ang|trēow|t1=tree|triewen|t2=wooden}}
#: {{suffixusex|ang|līn|t1=flax|līnen|t2=linen}}
#: {{suffixusex|ang|sǣ|t1=sea|sǣn|t2=marine}}
