{{inh|ang|gem-pro|*-an}}, from {{inh|ang|gem-pro|*-an-}}.

====Suffix====
{{h|ang|suf}}

# {{lb|ang|adjective suffix}} {{non-gloss|meaning belonging to or characterised by}}
#: {{suffixusex|ang|tungol|t1=star|tunglen|t2=of the stars, sidereal, starry}}
#: {{suffixusex|ang|fæder|t1=father|fæderen|t2=paternal, of a father}}
