===Etymology 1===
{{etymon|ang|:inh|gmw-pro:*-as|id=possessive}}
The a-stem genitive singular ending is derived from {{inh|ang|gmw-pro|*-as}}, from {{der|ang|gem-pro|*-as}}. Based on the voiceless *s, Ringe 2006 argues that this ending was analogically taken from the genitive singular determiner {{m|gem-pro|*sa|*þas}}, from {{m|ine-pro|*só|*tósyo}}.<ref>{{R:gem:PIEPG|page=201}}</ref>

