#: {{suffixusex|ang|hund|gloss1=dog|hundes|gloss2=dog's}}
#: {{suffixusex|ang|sċip|gloss1=ship|sċipes|gloss2=ship's}}
# {{n-g|forms the strong masculine/neuter genitive singular of adjectives}}
# {{n-g|used in formation of adverbs, originally from the genitive of masculine and neuter nouns, but later added also to feminine nouns by analogy}}
#: {{uxi|ang|[[dæġes|dæġ'''es''']]|by day|q=adverb}}
#: {{uxi|ang|[[nihtes|niht'''es''']]|by night|q=adverb}}

